# nwlab 検証環境用スキーマ（Dynamic VLAN）
# OIDは RFC 5612 の文書用プライベート企業番号 32473 配下を使用（ラボ用途）

attributetype ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.1.1
    NAME 'nwVlanId'
    DESC 'RADIUS Dynamic VLAN ID (Tunnel-Private-Group-Id)'
    EQUALITY integerMatch
    SYNTAX 1.3.6.1.4.1.1466.115.121.1.27
    SINGLE-VALUE )

attributetype ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.1.2
    NAME 'nwVlanPriority'
    DESC 'Group priority for Dynamic VLAN (smaller wins)'
    EQUALITY integerMatch
    ORDERING integerOrderingMatch
    SYNTAX 1.3.6.1.4.1.1466.115.121.1.27
    SINGLE-VALUE )

objectclass ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.1
    NAME 'nwRadiusUser'
    DESC 'Per-user RADIUS attributes'
    SUP top AUXILIARY
    MAY ( nwVlanId ) )

objectclass ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.2
    NAME 'nwRadiusGroup'
    DESC 'Per-group RADIUS attributes'
    SUP top AUXILIARY
    MAY ( nwVlanId $ nwVlanPriority ) )
